Valkyrie spoilers ahead

I played 3.0j for a long time, and came close to winning several times.  But
I never actually won.  Within about 3 days of getting 3.1, I had won.  There
is one thing in 3.1 that makes the game completely laughable:  valkyries.  I
always liked them, even in 3.0j, so I was playing with one when I discovered
that a valkyrie is walking death as soon as she finds an altar (and gets
Mjollnir automatically as her first artifact.)  Once she has the gauntlets
of power, she's unstoppable (short of doing something stupid.)  I must admit,
I was rather nonplussed when I saw all the messages about how tough Archons 
were...a high level valkyrie fears no monster.  The endgame was simply a 
slugfest, with no actual danger.
